Acts 25:1 , The Jews accuse Paul before Festus;
Acts 25:8 , He answers for himself
Acts 25:11 . and appeals unto Caesar;
Acts 25:14 , Afterwards Festus opens his matter to king Agrippa;
Acts 25:23 , and he is brought forth;
Acts 25:25 , Festus clears him of having done anything worthy of death.
